{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは(^^♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は毎日何かと動いております！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日、「太陽ノック」発売になりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回、高山•橋本•深川•白石の四人でカップリングのユニット曲「魚たちのLOVE SONG」を歌っています(^_^)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MV観て頂けたかな？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はロボットになりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2015/07/22/7546743/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロボット感を出すため、血色がありません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影中は、瞬きをしないようにと心掛けました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までにない雰囲気のMVで、とてもお気に入りです(^^♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2015/07/22/7546743/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"四人でワイワイ撮影したよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりユニットは歌ってても踊ってても楽しいから好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他にも個人PVなど見どころたくさんの12枚目シングルですので、是非皆さん、観て聴いてみてください(^-^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、初森べマーズ観て頂けてるでしょうか〜？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポラリスの練習方法、これからどんな風になっていくのだろう、、、ねっ(^_^)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キレイの台詞をよく練習しているコテちん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2015/07/22/7546743/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帽子を貸してみました笑ヽ(´ー｀)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とてもお似合いよ♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明後日、24日はミュージックステーションです！ みてねヽ(^^)ﾉ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2015/07/22/7546743/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"LARME017発売中！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2015/07/22/7546743/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回も可愛く撮って頂きました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クマと撮ったページがお気に入りです♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん外出するときは、こまめに水分を取るようにしてくださいね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう夏だ〜〜〜"}],"source":"archive"}